Got it! Looking at the primer, I can see you're working on enhancing Apprentice to support multi-step story learning. The system context and acceptance criteria are well-defined.

I want to understand the failure modes better. When you say "What happens when it fails, who gets hurt, blast radius" - what are the specific ways this story learning enhancement could go wrong? For example, what happens if the StoryCollector fails to properly aggregate multi-step interactions, or if the JourneyEvaluator miscalculates phase transitions?

